}

<div id="robotWorkspace" class="robot-page">
    <div class="robot-heading">
        <div><h1>机器人管理</h1><p>查看运行状态，按需配置人数与维护账户。</p></div>
        <span id="robotSnapshot" class="robot-muted" aria-live="polite">正在读取状态…</span>
    </div>
    <div class="robot-overview" aria-label="机器人全局概览">
        <div class="robot-stat"><span>账户总数</span><strong id="robotStatTotal">—</strong><small>全部机器人账户</small></div>
        <div class="robot-stat"><span>在线数</span><strong id="robotStatOnline">—</strong><small>当前已连接</small></div>
        <div class="robot-stat"><span>已入座</span><strong id="robotStatSeated">—</strong><small>当前占用座位</small></div>
        <div class="robot-stat"><span>空闲数</span><strong id="robotStatIdle">—</strong><small>未入座，含未上线</small></div>
    </div>
    <div class="robot-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="机器人管理功能">
        <button type="button" id="robot-tab-live" class="robot-tab is-active" data-tab="live" role="tab" aria-controls="robot-live" aria-selected="true">实时状态</button>
        <button type="button" id="robot-tab-quota" class="robot-tab" data-tab="quota" role="tab" aria-controls="robot-quota" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">座位配置</button>
        <button type="button" id="robot-tab-accounts" class="robot-tab" data-tab="accounts" role="tab" aria-controls="robot-accounts" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">账户管理</button>
        <button type="button" id="robot-tab-schedule" class="robot-tab" data-tab="schedule" role="tab" aria-controls="robot-schedule" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">自动调度</button>
    </div>

    <section id="robot-live" class="robot-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="robot-tab-live" aria-hidden="false">
        <div class="robot-section-heading"><div><h2>机器人当前状态</h2><p>查看机器人账户与入座状态，选择账户上线或调整座位。</p></div><button type="button" class="robot-button" onclick="queryRobotSeats();">刷新状态</button></div>
        <div id="robotSeatFilter" class="robot-filters">
            <label>账户 <input type="text" class="easyui-textbox" id="seatFilterAccount" style="width:140px;" data-options="prompt:'账户或昵称'" /></label>
            <label>游戏 <select class="easyui-combobox" id="seatFilterGame" style="width:150px;" data-options="valueField:'id',textField:'text',panelHeight:220,editable:false,data:[{id:-1,text:'全部游戏',selected:true}]"></select></label>
            <label>代理线 <select class="easyui-combobox" id="seatFilterLine" style="width:130px;" data-options="valueField:'id',textField:'text',panelHeight:200,editable:false,data:[{id:'*',text:'全部',selected:true}]"></select></label>
            <label>机台 <input type="text" class="easyui-textbox" id="seatFilterTable" style="width:125px;" data-options="prompt:'名称或编号'" /></label>
            <label>状态 <select class="easyui-combobox" id="seatFilterStatus" style="width:115px;" data-options="valueField:'id',textField:'text',editable:false,data:[{id:'all',text:'全部',selected:true},{id:'idle',text:'空闲（未入座）'},{id:'offline',text:'未上线'},{id:'seated',text:'已入座'}]"></select></label>
            <div class="robot-actions"><button type="button" class="robot-button robot-primary" onclick="filterRobotSeats();">筛选</button><button type="button" class="robot-button" onclick="resetRobotSeatFilter();">重置</button></div>
        </div>
        <table id="tb_RobotSeat"></table>
    </section>

    <section id="robot-quota" class="robot-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="robot-tab-quota" aria-hidden="true" style="display:none;">
        <div class="robot-section-heading"><div><h2>机器人目标配置</h2><p>按游戏与代理线设置人数；实际入座受空位和账户数量影响。</p></div>
            <div class="robot-actions"><button type="button" class="robot-button robot-primary" onclick="showAddWin();">设置机器人数量</button>
                <details class="robot-more"><summary class="robot-button">更多操作</summary><div><button type="button" class="robot-danger" onclick="this.closest('details').removeAttribute('open'); deleteAllRobot();">清空全部配置</button></div></details>
            </div>
        </div>
        <form id="frm_srch" class="robot-filters" onsubmit="queryData(); return false;">
            <label>游戏名称 <select class="easyui-combobox" name="GameId" id="quotaFilterGame" style="width:170px;" data-options="valueField:'id',textField:'text',panelHeight:220,editable:false,data:[{id:-1,text:'全部游戏',selected:true}]"></select></label>
            <label>代理线 <select class="easyui-combobox" name="LINE" id="srchLine" style="width:140px;" data-options="valueField:'id',textField:'text',panelHeight:200,editable:false,data:[{id:'*',text:'全部',selected:true}]"></select></label>
            <button type="submit" class="robot-button">查询配置</button>
        </form>
        <table id="tb_Robot">
            <thead><tr>
                <th field="GAME_NAME" width="180">游戏名称</th>
                <th field="LINE_AGENT" width="160" formatter="fmtLine">代理线</th>
                <th field="TOTAL_SEATS" width="110">开放座位</th>
                <th field="CONFIGURED_ROBOT_COUNT" width="110">目标人数</th>
                <th field="ROBOT_COUNT" width="110" formatter="fmtRobotCount">实际入座</th>
                <th field="ID" width="110" align="center" formatter="fmtOpt">操作</th>
            </tr></thead>
        </table>
    </section>

    <section id="robot-accounts" class="robot-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="robot-tab-accounts" aria-hidden="true" style="display:none;">
        <div class="robot-section-heading"><div><h2>机器人账户</h2><p>创建与维护账户；安排上线请切换到“实时状态”。</p></div>
            <div class="robot-actions"><button type="button" class="robot-button" onclick="showRobotAccountWin('');">新增账户</button><button type="button" class="robot-button robot-primary" onclick="showBatchRobotAccountWin();">批量创建账户</button></div>
        </div>
        <div class="robot-filters">
            <label>账户 <input id="accountFilter" class="easyui-textbox" style="width:200px;" data-options="prompt:'账户或昵称'" /></label>
            <button type="button" class="robot-button" onclick="queryRobotAccounts();">查询账户</button>
            <button type="button" class="robot-button" onclick="$('#accountFilter').textbox('clear'); queryRobotAccounts();">重置</button>
            <div class="robot-selection"><span id="robotSelectedCount">已选 0 个</span><button type="button" id="deleteSelectedAccounts" class="robot-button robot-danger" disabled onclick="batchDeleteRobotAccounts();">删除选中账户</button></div>
        </div>
        <table id="tb_RobotAccount"></table>
    </section>

    <section id="robot-schedule" class="robot-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="robot-tab-schedule" aria-hidden="true" style="display:none;">
        <div class="robot-section-heading"><div><h2>自动调度</h2><p>机器人按现有配置重新寻找空位，作用于全部游戏与代理线。</p></div></div>
        <div class="robot-schedule-card">
            <h3>最大游玩时间 <span id="playTimeStatus" class="robot-muted">正在读取…</span></h3>
            <p>每次成功入座后，在以下小时范围内随机分配游玩上限；超时后随机等待 1～5 分钟，由空闲机器人接替。牌机与拉霸重新随机选择空桌，其他游戏接替原座位。</p>
            <div class="robot-schedule-fields">
                <label><input type="checkbox" id="playTimeEnabled" /> 启用超时换人</label>
                <label>最短上限（小时） <input id="playTimeMinHours" class="easyui-numberbox" style="width:110px;" data-options="min:0.1,max:720,precision:1" value="2" /></label>
                <label>最长上限（小时） <input id="playTimeMaxHours" class="easyui-numberbox" style="width:110px;" data-options="min:0.1,max:720,precision:1" value="4" /></label>
            </div>
            <p class="robot-muted">支持 0.1～720 小时，两端相同表示固定时长。无空闲账号时保留原机器人并重试；保存后立即生效，已游玩时间继续计入。</p>
            <button type="button" id="saveRobotPlayTime" class="robot-button robot-primary" disabled onclick="saveRobotPlayTime();">保存游玩时长</button>
            <button type="button" class="robot-button" onclick="loadRobotPlayTime();">重新读取</button>
        </div>
        <div class="robot-schedule-card">
            <p class="robot-muted">牌机与拉霸普通入座、超时换人和打乱时，均随机选择空桌，允许两个机器人相邻，优先避免同一行连续 3 个及以上机器人；只有所有空桌都会形成这种连排时才放宽。真人邻桌可坐，有人占用或留机的桌不可坐。</p>
            <h3>每日定时打乱 <span id="scheduleStatus" class="robot-muted">正在读取…</span></h3>
            <p>每天在指定时间范围内执行一次，机器人以 1～5 秒的随机间隔逐个离座。</p>
            <div class="robot-schedule-fields">
                <label><input type="checkbox" id="shuffleEnabled" /> 启用每日打乱</label>
                <label>开始时间 <input id="shuffleStart" class="easyui-timespinner" style="width:110px;" data-options="showSeconds:false" value="02:00" /></label>
                <label>结束时间 <input id="shuffleEnd" class="easyui-timespinner" style="width:110px;" data-options="showSeconds:false" value="05:00" /></label>
            </div>
            <p class="robot-muted">跨午夜时，开始时间可晚于结束时间，例如 23:00 至 02:00。</p>
            <button type="button" id="saveRobotSchedule" class="robot-button robot-primary" disabled onclick="saveRobotShuffleSchedule();">保存定时设置</button>
            <button type="button" class="robot-button" onclick="loadRobotShuffleSchedule();">重新读取</button>
        </div>
        <div class="robot-schedule-card robot-manual-shuffle">
            <div><h3>手动调度</h3><p>立即让当前已入座的机器人逐个离座，再按配置寻找空位。</p></div>
            <details class="robot-more"><summary class="robot-button">更多操作</summary><div><button type="button" class="robot-danger" onclick="this.closest('details').removeAttribute('open'); showShuffleWin();">打乱全部机器人</button></div></details>
        </div>
    </section>
</div>

